rict).\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\"" 13194139534834 true] [17592186313440 1000 #edb/ref 17592186313441 13194139534834 true] [17592186313440 1000 #edb/ref 17592186313442 13194139534834 true] [17592186313440 1000 #edb/ref 17592186313443 13194139534834 true] [17592186313440 1000 #edb/ref 17592186313444 13194139534834 true] [17592186313440 1000 #edb/ref 17592186313445 13194139534834 true] [17592186313440 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534834 true] [17592186313440 1041 "selection" 13194139534834 true] [17592186313440 1104 #edb/ref 17592186313445 13194139534834 true] [17592186313440 1110 #uuid "e6a9d081-809c-51a0-b066-87a6237928fa" 13194139534834 true] [17592186313441 1034 "II and III only" 13194139534834 true] [17592186313441 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534834 true] [17592186313441 1111 #uuid "635e058d-dad8-552d-8a4a-c548bafbe782" 13194139534834 true] [17592186313442 1034 "I and III only" 13194139534834 true] [17592186313442 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534834 true] [17592186313442 1111 #uuid "385e4778-985d-5e03-9be2-f6e0f9dc9cf4" 13194139534834 true] [17592186313443 1034 "I only" 13194139534834 true] [17592186313443 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534834 true] [17592186313443 1111 #uuid "90fc032f-75d8-5939-8ced-84e69ab270ba" 13194139534834 true] [17592186313444 1034 "I and II only" 13194139534834 true] [17592186313444 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534834 true] [17592186313444 1111 #uuid "ccdf5cc6-1487-5ca7-b474-001715203b52" 13194139534834 true] [17592186313445 1034 "II only" 13194139534834 true] [17592186313445 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534834 true] [17592186313445 1111 #uuid "ae4585da-32e2-5518-bdcf-a999396955e5" 13194139534834 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-105185" 17592186313348 "q-105185/selection" 17592186313349 "q-105185/selection/1f1f2fe9df6485d5cdc7916416b2f79699d874348406e639d5daec02cb2e57e6" 17592186313350 "q-105185/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" 1759218631